</div>
```

**Step 3: Style the tooltip**

Use CSS to style the tooltip. We'll make it invisible by default and display it when the user hovers over the SVG.

```css
#tooltip {
  position: absolute;
  background-color: #fff;
  border: 1px solid #ddd;
  padding: 10px;
  font-size: 14px;
  visibility: hidden;
}

#tooltip.hidden {
  visibility: hidden;
}

#svg-container:hover #tooltip {
  visibility: visible;
}
