2. By case-sensitive alphabetical order.
3. If two books have the same starting letter, sort them based on their lengths in descending order.
4. If two books have the same starting letter and length, sort them based on their ASCII values in descending order.
5. If two books have the same starting letter, length, and ASCII value, keep the original order of those books.

